-jail-in-murder-case/articleshow/122912445.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/dhaka-court-sends-former-cj-to-jail-in-murder-case/articleshow/122912445.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:49:50+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122912451,imgsize-25308.cms"/></item><item><title>Haven’t considered clemency for Maxwell: Trump</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122912432.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/havent-considered-clemency-for-maxwell-trump/articleshow/122912432.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/havent-considered-clemency-for-maxwell-trump/articleshow/122912432.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:49:14+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122912431,imgsize-39994.cms"/></item><item><title>A Hindu temple among flashpoints</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122912400.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-hindu-temple-among-flashpoints/articleshow/122912400.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-hindu-temple-among-flashpoints/articleshow/122912400.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:44:49+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122912405,imgsize-1471175.cms"/></item><item><title>Thailand warns of war with Cambodia, clashes enter day 2</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122912364.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/thailand-warns-of-war-with-cambodia-clashes-enter-day-2/articleshow/122912364.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/thailand-warns-of-war-with-cambodia-clashes-enter-day-2/articleshow/122912364.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:42:02+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122912398,imgsize-1575711.cms"/></item><item><title>Pakistani army chief in China to deepen ties, meets VP, top military official</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122912330.cms" /&gt;Pakistan's army chief Asim Munir visited China, engaging in discussions with top leaders to enhance cooperation across various sectors. This visit follows India's Operation Sindoor and Pakistan's use of Chinese military equipment during the conflict. Munir's trip also comes after his visit to Washington, seeking closer ties with the US, while Pakistan's foreign minister is also in Washington for meetings.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/pakistani-army-chief-in-china-to-deepen-ties-meets-vp-top-military-official/articleshow/122912330.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/pakistani-army-chief-in-china-to-deepen-ties-meets-vp-top-military-official/articleshow/122912330.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:38:28+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122912345,imgsize-508539.cms"/></item><item><title>Netanyahu, Trump ditch Gaza ceasefire talks</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122912291.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/netanyahu-trump-ditch-gaza-ceasefire-talks/articleshow/122912291.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/netanyahu-trump-ditch-gaza-ceasefire-talks/articleshow/122912291.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:35:33+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122912299,imgsize-756724.cms"/></item><item><title>Move a launchpad to annihilate Israel: Bibi</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122912278.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/move-a-launchpad-to-annihilate-israel-bibi/articleshow/122912278.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/move-a-launchpad-to-annihilate-israel-bibi/articleshow/122912278.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:34:51+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122912260,imgsize-842720.cms"/></item><item><title>What Macron says doesn’t matter: Donald Trump</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122912217.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-macron-says-doesnt-matter-donald-trump/articleshow/122912217.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-macron-says-doesnt-matter-donald-trump/articleshow/122912217.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:31:36+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122912215,imgsize-32794.cms"/></item><item><title>France will recognise Palestine state: Macron; 1st in G7 to do so</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122912142.cms" /&gt;President Emmanuel Macron declared France's forthcoming recognition of Palestine as a state, emphasizing its commitment to Middle East peace. This announcement, set for the UN General Assembly in September, follows growing global concern over the Gaza conflict. While other European nations have taken similar steps, France's status as a nuclear power and UNSC member amplifies the decision's significance.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/france-will-recognise-palestine-state-macron-1st-in-g7-to-do-so/articleshow/122912142.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/france-will-recognise-palestine-state-macron-1st-in-g7-to-do-so/articleshow/122912142.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:26:51+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122912146,imgsize-18898.cms"/></item><item><title>'Tax the Rich': AOC flouted House Rules in 2021 Met Gala, accepted gifts, gave boyfriend free ticket</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122911960.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/tax-the-rich-aoc-flouted-house-rules-in-2021-met-gala-accepted-gifts-gave-boyfriend-free-ticket/articleshow/122911960.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/tax-the-rich-aoc-flouted-house-rules-in-2021-met-gala-accepted-gifts-gave-boyfriend-free-ticket/articleshow/122911960.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:20:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122911984,imgsize-56888.cms"/></item><item><title>Two years on, Imran Khan's sons step in as protest call rattles Islamabad</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122911552.cms" /&gt;As Imran Khan marks two years in jail, his sons are lobbying in the US for his release, coinciding with Khan's call for nationwide protests. Khan faces convictions in multiple cases, which PTI alleges are politically motivated. With PTI leadership weakened, the state is cracking down, sentencing party leaders amidst a fractured political landscape and accusations against the army chief.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/two-years-on-imran-khans-sons-step-in-as-protest-call-rattles-islamabad/articleshow/122911552.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/two-years-on-imran-khans-sons-step-in-as-protest-call-rattles-islamabad/articleshow/122911552.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-26T00:00:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Omer Farooq Khan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122911549,imgsize-565768.cms"/></item></channel></rss>